0008: client.freeIdleBufferCopiesSec (internal 0014): free the client's copy of a static vertex / index buffer (64 KB to 4 MB) not locked for N s; the next lock fetches it back (Lock with ReturnData), checked by a CRC32C.

Applies after 0001-0007 on NVIDIAGameWorks/dxvk-remix f35b86a (bridge/ only).

